{"id":346380,"date":"2020-08-11T22:14:28","date_gmt":"2020-08-11T22:14:28","guid":{"rendered":"http:\/\/ccra.us\/?p=346380"},"modified":"2020-08-11T22:16:35","modified_gmt":"2020-08-11T22:16:35","slug":"fcc-announces-new-version-of-fcc-speed-test-app","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"http:\/\/ccra.us\/2020\/08\/11\/fcc-announces-new-version-of-fcc-speed-test-app\/","title":{"rendered":"FCC Announces New Version of FCC Speed Test Application"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<p>WASHINGTON, August 3, 2020\u2014The Federal Communications Commission announced today the release of an updated version of its FCC Speed Test app.  This app, available from the Apple App Store and Google Play, has been updated to work the with latest versions of the iOS and Android operating systems.&nbsp; Like its predecessor, the updated app allows users to test their cellular and Wi-Fi network performance for download and upload speed, latency, jitter, and packet loss.&nbsp; Consistent with the FCC\u2019s commitment to maintaining user privacy, the app collects no personal or uniquely identifiable information.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p><a href=\"http:\/\/ccra.us\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/08\/DOC-365915A1.pdf\">FCC announces New Version of FCC Speed Test App<\/a>.<\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>WASHINGTON, August 3, 2020\u2014The Federal Communications Commission announced today the release of an updated version of its FCC Speed Test app. This app, available from the Apple App Store and <a class=\"more-link\" href=\"http:\/\/ccra.us\/2020\/08\/11\/fcc-announces-new-version-of-fcc-speed-test-app\/\">Continue Reading &rarr;<\/a><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"_jetpack_newsletter_access":"","_jetpack_dont_email_post_to_subs":false,"_jetpack_newsletter_tier_id":0,"_jetpack_memberships_contains_paywalled_content":false,"_jetpack_memberships_contains_pa